      "message": "I\u0027m trying to separate the APIs(especially exception tests) to their own files to simplify readability of tests.\nHappy to move this to UrlRequestTest but I\u0027ll also have to move the other urlrequest-related exception tests too.\n\nPrefer to leave as-is though, unless you strongly object.",
